 dlls/msvcp60/msvcp60.spec |  72 +++++++++++++++----------------
 dlls/msvcp90/exception.c  | 107 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 57 deletions(-)

